# The build context is the repository root, and the image is public: only the paths named here go
# in, so nothing local (.git and its credentials, .env files, comfyui/, environments) ever does.
*
!comfy.lock
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!cli/
!engine/
!web/
!docker/Caddyfile
!docker/entrypoint.sh

# made by the image itself, or local
cli/.venv/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.dist-*
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
